      "name": "dsh-web-search-lite",
      "title": {
        "en": "Web Search Lite",
        "zh": "网络搜索 Lite"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Queries DuckDuckGo, Bing, Baidu and 360 at once and merges the results, plus page fetch. No API key needed; an optional key (Tavily, Serper, Brave, Exa, Bing API, SearXNG) makes it steadier. Adds two new tools and its own Settings section; it does not touch the built-in web_search.",
        "zh": "同时查询 DuckDuckGo、Bing 网页、百度、360 并合并结果，另带网页正文读取。不需要 API Key；愿意配一家（Tavily、Serper、Brave、Exa、Bing API、SearXNG）会更稳。只新增两个工具和自己的设置页，不干预内置 web_search。"
      },
